{
  "info": {
    "name": "SIGV — Backend API",
    "description": "Collection de test du backend SIGV (contrôle d'accès, scan MRZ).\n\n## Démarrage rapide\n\n1. Importez aussi `SIGV.postman_environment.json` et sélectionnez l'environnement **SIGV — Local**.\n2. Lancez **Auth / Login** : les tokens sont enregistrés automatiquement dans l'environnement, toutes les autres requêtes s'authentifient seules.\n3. Pour **OCR / Scan MRZ**, ouvrez l'onglet *Body* et sélectionnez votre photo dans le champ `mrz_image` (Postman ne peut pas mémoriser un chemin de fichier à l'import).\n\nLes requêtes enchaînent leurs variables : un scan alimente `visitor_*`, un service alimente `service_id`, etc. Vous pouvez donc lancer la collection entière avec le Collection Runner.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Garde-fou : rappelle de lancer Login si aucun token n'est en mémoire.",
          "const publiques = ['/auth/login', '/auth/refresh', '/auth/forgot-password', '/health'];",
          "const url = pm.request.url.getPath();",
          "if (!publiques.some(p => url.endsWith(p)) && !pm.environment.get('access_token')) {",
          "  console.warn('Aucun access_token : lancez d\\'abord la requête Auth / Login.');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', b.access_token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('refresh_token', b.refresh_token);",
                  "pm.test('tokens reçus', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(b.access_token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.user.identifiant).to.eql(pm.environment.get('identifiant'));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('aucun hash de mot de passe exposé', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(JSON.stringify(b)).to.not.include('mot_de_passe_hash');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifiant\": \"{{identifiant}}\",\n  \"mot_de_passe\": \"{{mot_de_passe}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Enregistre `access_token` et `refresh_token` dans l'environnement."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('profil de l\\'agent connecté', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().identifiant).to.eql(pm.environment.get('identifiant'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "me"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', pm.response.json().access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot password",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifiant\": \"{{identifiant}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "forgot-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Répond toujours 202, sans révéler si le compte existe (stub, voir ADR-006)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "// Le refresh token est révoqué : le rejouer doit désormais échouer en 401.",
                  "pm.environment.unset('access_token');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "À lancer en dernier : révoque le refresh token et vide le token courant."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "OCR MRZ",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Scan MRZ (upload photo)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('checksums ICAO valides', () => pm.expect(b.mrz_valid).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('identité extraite', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(b.fields.nom).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(b.fields.numero_document).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('NIN extrait automatiquement (CNI sénégalaise)', () => {",
                  "  if (b.document_type === 'CNI') {",
                  "    pm.expect(b.fields.nin, 'NIN absent — vérifier la lisibilité du verso').to.be.a('string');",
                  "  }",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Latence serveur (ms) :', b.processing_time_ms);",
                  "",
                  "// Alimente la création de visite qui suit.",
                  "const f = b.fields;",
                  "pm.environment.set('visitor_nom', f.nom);",
                  "pm.environment.set('visitor_prenom', f.prenom);",
                  "pm.environment.set('visitor_numero_document', f.numero_document);",
                  "pm.environment.set('visitor_nin', f.nin || '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('visitor_nationalite', f.nationalite || '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('visitor_date_naissance', f.date_naissance || '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('visitor_sexe', f.sexe || '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('visitor_date_expiration', f.date_expiration || '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('type_document', b.document_type);",
                  "pm.environment.set('mrz_image_url', b.mrz_image_url || '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "mrz_image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Face du document portant le MRZ (verso de CNI). jpg, jpeg, png ou heic, 10 Mo max."
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/ocr/scan",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "ocr",
                "scan"
              ]
            },
            "description": "⚠️ Sélectionnez le fichier dans l'onglet **Body → form-data**, ligne `mrz_image` (type *File*). Postman ne conserve pas les chemins de fichiers à l'import.\n\nComptez ~6 s de réponse sur CPU : l'inférence OCR domine (voir ADR-013)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Voir l'image conservée",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{mrz_image_url}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}{{mrz_image_url}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sert l'image archivée pour audit. Disponible hors production uniquement."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Erreur — fichier non supporté (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('400 avec le format d\\'erreur standard', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b).to.have.all.keys('error_code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.error_code).to.eql('UNSUPPORTED_IMAGE');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "mrz_image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Sélectionnez volontairement un PDF ou un .txt."
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/ocr/scan",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "ocr",
                "scan"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fichiers",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Déposer la signature",
          "event": [
